WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.660
Metal Seedramon had followed us from the underwater channels and was now in a fierce battle with our Digis.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:11.040
In the midst of all of it, he released his river of power and hit Waymon with a devastating blast.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.630
Poor Greymon had no other choice but to use his Terra Force to finally put an end to Metal Seedramon.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.820
Sadly, our friend Waymon was reconfigured as well.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.670
As the ocean started to disappear, we took it as a sign that things might get back to normal.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.520
The odds of that happening anytime soon? Not good.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.400
Yes!

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:00.840
